{
  "component": "p08",
  "pages": [
    {
      "text": "EVERYTHING'S READY. THE BUFFET SHOULD BE THE FIRST\nTHING THE GUESTS SEE.",
      "record_id": "P08.SCENE.001",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 1,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 1,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "I SHOULD BE THE FIRST THING. I INVITED THEM.",
      "record_id": "P08.SCENE.001",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 3,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 2,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "AND THEIR FIRST STEP LANDS WHERE? THE BUFFET,\nSOUND AND DISPLAY CAN'T ALL HAVE THE DOORWAY.\nDOORWAYS ARE FOR WALKING.",
      "record_id": "P08.SCENE.001",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 5,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "frankie",
      "speaker_number": 3,
      "voice_index": 3,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU STAND IN THEM WHEN YOU'RE RIGHT.",
      "record_id": "P08.SCENE.001",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 6,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 4,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "SO EVERYBODY HEARS. NOW LET'S LEAVE THIS ONE\nCLEAR.",
      "record_id": "P08.SCENE.001",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 7,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "frankie",
      "speaker_number": 3,
      "voice_index": 5,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "RIGHT. THE PLANS SHOW WHERE EVERYTHING FITS.",
      "record_id": "P08.SCENE.001",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 8,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 6,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "GATE-TO-HOUSE LANE",
      "record_id": "P08.LABEL.001",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 10,
      "header_entry": 9,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "CHEVRONS MARK THE CLEAR GATE-TO-HOUSE LANE. GUESTS\nMUST BE ABLE TO GET PAST THE FIRST PERSON WHO\nWANTS TO EXPLAIN SOMETHING.",
      "record_id": "P08.LOOK.001",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 11,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 7,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "HATCH-SIDE BUFFET POSITION",
      "record_id": "P08.LABEL.002",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 12,
      "header_entry": 9,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "THE TRAY MARK IS BELOW THE KITCHEN HATCH: FOOD\nTHROUGH THE HATCH, BUFFET UNDERNEATH. MY COOKING\nCAN MAKE AN ENTRANCE WITHOUT ME BLOCKING THE DOOR.",
      "record_id": "P08.LOOK.002",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 13,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 8,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "INWARD-FACING SPEAKER POSITION",
      "record_id": "P08.LABEL.003",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 14,
      "header_entry": 9,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "THE SOUND MARK IS BY THE WALL. THE SPEAKER FACES\nINWARD TOWARD OUR COURTYARD AND THE HOUSE. THE\nNEIGHBOR IS ALLOWED TO HAVE A DIFFERENT EVENING.",
      "record_id": "P08.LOOK.003",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 15,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 9,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "DISPLAY ALCOVE",
      "record_id": "P08.LABEL.004",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 16,
      "header_entry": 9,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "A PANEL-SHAPED FOOTPRINT IN THE ALCOVE. VIVIAN'S\nMARK SHOWS WHERE THE SCREEN CONCEALS IT FROM\nARRIVING GUESTS.",
      "record_id": "P08.LOOK.004",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 17,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 10,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "SMALL SERVING TABLE",
      "record_id": "P08.LABEL.005",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 18,
      "header_entry": 9,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "A SERVING TABLE I CAN PUSH OR PULL UNDER THE\nHATCH, INTO THE TRAY FOOTPRINT. EASIER TO MOVE\nTHAN A GUEST WHO HAS STARTED TELLING YOU",
      "record_id": "P08.LOOK.005",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 19,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 11,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "SOMETHING.",
      "record_id": "P08.LOOK.005",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 20,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 12,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "KITCHEN HATCH",
      "record_id": "P08.LABEL.006",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 21,
      "header_entry": 9,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "THE KITCHEN HATCH AND BUFFET POSITION SHARE A TRAY\nSYMBOL. KEEP THE HATCH IN CLEAR VIEW. I WANT\nPEOPLE ADMIRING THE FOOD BEFORE THEY START ASKING",
      "record_id": "P08.LOOK.006",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 22,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 13,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "WHAT'S IN IT.",
      "record_id": "P08.LOOK.006",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 23,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 14,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "COURTYARD PLAN OVERLAY",
      "record_id": "P08.LABEL.007",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 24,
      "header_entry": 9,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "THREE PLACEMENTS, ONE CLEAR ROUTE: BUFFET AT THE\nHATCH, SOUND FACING INWARD, SCREEN AT THE DISPLAY\nALCOVE. KEEP THE CHEVRONS EMPTY.",
      "record_id": "P08.LOOK.007",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 25,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 15,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "GATE TO HOUSE: KEEP THE CHEVRON-MARKED LANE CLEAR.",
      "record_id": "P08.READ.001",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 27,
      "header_entry": 26,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "SCREEN AT THE MARKED SIDE OF THE DISPLAY ALCOVE.\nHIDE THE DISPLAY FROM ARRIVALS. KEEP THE KITCHEN\nHATCH VISIBLE.",
      "record_id": "P08.READ.002",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 28,
      "header_entry": 26,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "TRAY: BUFFET BELOW THE HATCH\nSOUND: SPEAKER AT THE WALL, FACING INWARD\nPANEL: SCREENED DISPLAY ALCOVE",
      "record_id": "P08.READ.003",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 30,
      "header_entry": 29,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "CHEVRONS: CLEAR WALKING LANE",
      "record_id": "P08.READ.003",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 31,
      "header_entry": 29,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "THE CARRIER IS AT THE BUFFET BELOW THE HATCH.\nRITA'S PLATES CAN BE LAID OUT HERE.",
      "record_id": "P08.SUCCESS.001",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 32,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 16,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "PLATES LAID OUT. THE PADDING'S FREE TO GO BACK TO\nTHE KITCHEN.",
      "record_id": "P08.SUCCESS.002",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 33,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 17,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "TEA TOWEL RETURNED TO THE KITCHEN LINEN HOOK.",
      "record_id": "P08.SYSTEM.001",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 35,
      "header_entry": 34,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "SPARE NAPKIN RETURNED TO THE KITCHEN LINEN HOOK.",
      "record_id": "P08.SYSTEM.002",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 36,
      "header_entry": 34,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "THE PA IS AT THE MARKED WALL, FACING INTO THE\nCOURTYARD. AN ANNOUNCEMENT OF SUPPER FOR PEOPLE\nWHO ARE ACTUALLY GETTING SOME.",
      "record_id": "P08.SUCCESS.003",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 37,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 18,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "THE SCREEN CONCEALS THE DISPLAY ALCOVE. THE GATE\nLANE AND KITCHEN VIEW STAY CLEAR.",
      "record_id": "P08.SUCCESS.004",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 38,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 19,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "THE SERVING TABLE IS UNDER THE HATCH, INSIDE THE\nTRAY FOOTPRINT.",
      "record_id": "P08.SUCCESS.005",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 39,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 20,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "THE SERVING TABLE IS UNDER THE HATCH, INSIDE THE\nTRAY FOOTPRINT.",
      "record_id": "P08.SUCCESS.006",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 39,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 21,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "RITA'S NAME, RIGHT BESIDE HER WORK. THE CREDIT\nGETS TO STAY ON SHOW AFTER I COVER EVERYTHING ELSE\nIN GRAVY.",
      "record_id": "P08.SUCCESS.007",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 40,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 22,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "CERAMIC SERVICE BY RITA STRINGER.",
      "record_id": "P08.READ.004",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 42,
      "header_entry": 41,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "THAT BLOCKS THE GATE-TO-HOUSE LANE. MOVE IT OFF\nTHE CHEVRONS SO PEOPLE CAN WALK THROUGH. WE CAN'T\nASK THEM TO ARRIVE SIDEWAYS.",
      "record_id": "P08.FAILURE.001",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 43,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 23,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "THAT HIDES THE KITCHEN HATCH. MOVE THE SCREEN TO\nTHE MARKED DISPLAY ALCOVE; ONLY RITA'S DISPLAY\nNEEDS HIDING. IF BUNNY CAN'T SEE DINNER, I'LL",
      "record_id": "P08.FAILURE.002",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 44,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 24,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "NEVER HEAR THE END OF IT.",
      "record_id": "P08.FAILURE.002",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 45,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 25,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "THE GRILLE POINTS AT THE NEIGHBOR. TURN IT INWARD,\nTOWARD OUR COURTYARD AND THE HOUSE. AT THE MOMENT\nOUR BEST SEAT IS NEXT DOOR.",
      "record_id": "P08.FAILURE.003",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 46,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 26,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "ARRIVALS CAN SEE THE DISPLAY BEFORE RITA HAS\nCHOSEN HER MOMENT. USE VIVIAN'S MARKED SIDE OF THE\nALCOVE. RITA HASN'T PRACTISED LOOKING MODEST FOR",
      "record_id": "P08.FAILURE.004",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 47,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 27,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "NOTHING.",
      "record_id": "P08.FAILURE.004",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 48,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 28,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "BUFFET AT HATCH: READY\nPA AT WALL, FACING INWARD: READY\nDISPLAY ALCOVE SCREENED: READY",
      "record_id": "P08.SYSTEM.003",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 50,
      "header_entry": 49,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "GATE-TO-HOUSE LANE: CLEAR",
      "record_id": "P08.SYSTEM.003",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 51,
      "header_entry": 49,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "WE CAN GET THROUGH. WE CAN HEAR. WE CAN SERVE.",
      "record_id": "P08.DIALOGUE.001",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 52,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 29,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "IT WORKS.",
      "record_id": "P08.DIALOGUE.001",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 53,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "frankie",
      "speaker_number": 3,
      "voice_index": 30,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "AND EVERYBODY I INVITED IS COMING TO THE SAME\nEVENING.",
      "record_id": "P08.DIALOGUE.001",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 54,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 31,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "WITH ROOM TO GET THEIR SUPPER WITHOUT TURNING\nSIDEWAYS.",
      "record_id": "P08.DIALOGUE.001",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 55,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 32,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "RITA'S PANEL STAYS HIDDEN UNTIL AFTER THE MEAL,\nWHEN SHE PRESENTS IT.",
      "record_id": "P08.DIALOGUE.001",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 56,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 33,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "AGREED.",
      "record_id": "P08.DIALOGUE.001",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 57,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "frankie",
      "speaker_number": 3,
      "voice_index": 34,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "WE'RE READY TO START.",
      "record_id": "P08.CHOICE.001",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 58,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "BUFFET AND RITA'S CREDIT AT THE HATCH. SOUND\nFACING INWARD. SCREEN IN THE ALCOVE. GATE LANE\nCLEAR.",
      "record_id": "P08.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 59,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "frankie",
      "speaker_number": 3,
      "voice_index": 35,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "AND EIGHT TASTING PORTIONS READY IN THE KITCHEN.",
      "record_id": "P08.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 60,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 36,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "GOOD. SHALL WE BEGIN?",
      "record_id": "P08.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 61,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "frankie",
      "speaker_number": 3,
      "voice_index": 37,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "BEGIN THE EVENING?\nPEOPLE WILL MOVE TO THEIR EVENING POSITIONS.\nESSENTIAL AREAS AND ITEMS WILL REMAIN ACCESSIBLE.",
      "record_id": "P08.SYSTEM.004",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 62,
      "header_entry": 34,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "YOUR GAME WILL BE AUTOSAVED BEFORE THE CHANGE.",
      "record_id": "P08.SYSTEM.004",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 63,
      "header_entry": 34,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "BEGIN THE EVENING.",
      "record_id": "P08.CHOICE.002",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 64,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "NOT YET.",
      "record_id": "P08.CHOICE.003",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 65,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "STILL PREPARING. TALK TO FRANKIE WHEN YOU'RE READY\nTO BEGIN.",
      "record_id": "P08.SYSTEM.005",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 66,
      "header_entry": 34,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "GAME SAVED. THE EVENING IS BEGINNING.",
      "record_id": "P08.SYSTEM.006",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 67,
      "header_entry": 34,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "USE THE PLANS TO GIVE EACH ACTIVITY ITS OWN PLACE,\nWITH A CLEAR ROUTE BETWEEN THE GATE AND HOUSE.",
      "record_id": "P08.HINT.1",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 69,
      "header_entry": 68,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "MATCH TRAY TO BUFFET, SOUND TO PA, AND PANEL TO\nTHE SCREENED ALCOVE. THE CHEVRON LANE STAYS EMPTY.",
      "record_id": "P08.HINT.2",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 70,
      "header_entry": 68,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "PUT THE CARRIER AND SERVING TABLE UNDER THE HATCH,\nWITH RITA'S CREDIT BESIDE THE PLATES. PLACE THE PA\nAT THE WALL FACING THE HOUSE, AND THE SCREEN AT",
      "record_id": "P08.HINT.3",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 71,
      "header_entry": 68,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "THE MARKED DISPLAY ALCOVE. KEEP THE GATE LANE\nCLEAR, THEN TELL FRANKIE YOU'RE READY.",
      "record_id": "P08.HINT.3",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 72,
      "header_entry": 68,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "RITA AND I ARE GOING BACK TO THE CONSERVATORY TO\nFINISH SOMETHING. WE'LL BE CLOSE BY.",
      "record_id": "TRANSITION.P08.01",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 74,
      "header_entry": 73,
      "speaker_id": "stringer",
      "speaker_number": 4,
      "voice_index": 38,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "WE'LL BRING MY DISPLAY WHEN IT'S TIME. KEEP ITS\nPLACE HIDDEN FOR ME.",
      "record_id": "TRANSITION.P08.01",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 76,
      "header_entry": 75,
      "speaker_id": "rita",
      "speaker_number": 7,
      "voice_index": 39,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "I'LL PUT OUT THE WELCOME SNACKS IN THE KITCHEN.",
      "record_id": "TRANSITION.P08.01",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 77,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 40,
      "audio_module": 918
    },
    {
      "text": "I'LL CHECK OUR CUES AT THE LIVING-ROOM BOARD.",
      "record_id": "TRANSITION.P08.01",
      "resource": 208,
      "entry": 78,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "frankie",
      "speaker_number": 3,
